{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_doc", "label": "Website Platform E2E Evidence Matrix (Issue #273)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/website-platform-e2e-evidence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_matrix", "label": "Epic #261/#273 acceptance-criteria evidence matrix", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/website-platform-e2e-evidence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Maps every DoD/acceptance criterion to concrete in-repo test/command/artifact, honestly labelling covered vs deferred. Integration suite gated on DATABASE_URL (route handlers run as least-privilege awcms_micro_app so FORCE RLS is exercised); CI green is the proof, not a local check. Three new cross-feature suites close the 'proven together' gap per-module tests structurally cannot."}, {"id": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_deferred_work", "label": "Deferred work (pilot / real-infra drills)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/website-platform-e2e-evidence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Criteria needing a deployed instance/real infra tracked as atomic issues #292-#296. Partial real-infra landed on dinkes-prod (awcms-micro.ahlikoding.com): image builds/boots on Coolify, live-edge security verified (HSTS/strict CSP/headers/Let's Encrypt), R2 configured. Config gap: apex host tenant-by-host resolution not mapped so SEO discovery surfaces (sitemap/feeds) return 404."}, {"id": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_template_positioning", "label": "Direct-use template positioning (ADR-0034/0036)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/website-platform-e2e-evidence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AWCMS-Micro is a full-online website template used directly (spectrum reaches online store; NOT in-store POS, that is the ERP awcms lineage). Pilot is a generic website/online store, NOT ahliweb/awpos. The derived-application pathway (application-registry + compatibility manifest + extension:check) is REMOVED (ADR-0036 supersedes ADR-0034/0035) \u2014 composition validates the base registry."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_doc", "target": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_matrix", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/website-platform-e2e-evidence.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_doc", "target": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_deferred_work", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/website-platform-e2e-evidence.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_doc", "target": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_template_positioning", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/website-platform-e2e-evidence.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_doc", "target": "docs_awcms_micro_resilience_dr_verification_doc", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/website-platform-e2e-evidence.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_awcms_micro_website_platform_e2e_evidence_deferred_work", "target": "docs_awcms_micro_resilience_dr_verification_rto_rpo", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTR